<title>USA: Westmark Group says Q1 loan production up.</title>
<headline>Westmark Group says Q1 loan production up.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westmark Group Holdings Inc said on Wednesday that loan production at its Westmark Mortgage unit in the first quarter increased to $19.8 million from $4.8 million in last year's first quarter.</p>
<p>Westmark Mortgage achieved a 519 percent increase in higher credit risk loans March 1997 over the comparable period in 1996, it said.</p>
<p>In March the company posted $7.9 million in the higher risk loans that carry higher interest rates, up from $1.27 million in March 1996.</p>
</text>
